@host = http://localhost:5242

### Logg inn som admin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@brukt.no", "password": "Passord1!" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Hvem er jeg?
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mine favoritter
GET {{host}}/api/favorites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Legg til favoritt
POST {{host}}/api/favorites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Fjern favoritt
DELETE {{host}}/api/favorites/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Slett kategori med annonser (skal gi 409)
DELETE {{host}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}